// ---- the initial mesh: Palace's adaptive refinement converges the answer ------------------
// Largest element per material: 0.1 of its wavelength at 18 GHz;
// 0.2 of the smallest at conductors and sheets; at most 1/4 of each port
// sheet's smaller side at the ports; growing by 1.3.
Mesh.MeshSizeMax = 1665.513655556;
